# Cargo package: the sum is of Buildroot's vendored, re-packed archive
# (see bmcd.hash for the toolchain trap this shares).
#
# The version is commit a6c2c07 on excavador-turing/tpi, released as v1.1.1:
# `firmware install` can install an image parked on the SD card (1.1.0 posted
# it to an endpoint the daemon refuses for local sources), and the default
# host says so when the name does not resolve.
#
# Measured with rust-bin 1.98.1 in the pinned container: `make tpi-source`
# reported got 733377bf against a blank expectation, then re-run to confirm.
